IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. SHADOW-WIZARD-PAYROLL.
AUTHOR. THE-SHADOW-WIZARD-MONEY-GANG.

DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 STOLEN-MONEY     PIC 9(7) VALUE 9999999.
01 WIZARDS-EMPLOYED  PIC 9(3) VALUE 42.
01 PAY-PER-WIZARD   PIC 9(5).

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    COMPUTE PAY-PER-WIZARD = STOLEN-MONEY / WIZARDS-EMPLOYED.
    DISPLAY "SHADOW WIZARD MONEY GANG PAYROLL SYSTEM".
    DISPLAY "TOTAL STOLEN: $" STOLEN-MONEY.
    DISPLAY "WIZARDS ON PAYROLL: " WIZARDS-EMPLOYED.
    DISPLAY "PAY PER WIZARD: $" PAY-PER-WIZARD.
    DISPLAY "STATUS: PLAYER IS COMING WITH WICKED SPELLS".
    DISPLAY "RECOMMENDATION: RUN".
    STOP RUN.
